"Let's give our physics layers a name. Go to *Project -> Project Settings*."
msgstr "让我们来为物理层命名。打开\\ *项目 -> 项目设置*\\ 。"

msgid ""
"In the left menu, navigate down to *Layer Names -> 3D Physics*. You can see "
