msgid "Character animation"
msgstr "角色动画"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In this final lesson, we'll use Rebel Engine's built-in animation tools to "
"make our characters float and flap. You'll learn to design animations in the "
"editor and use code to make your game feel alive."
msgstr ""
"这是最后一课，我们会使用 Godot 的内置动画工具制作角色的浮动和拍打动画。你会学"
