msgid "Project setup"
msgstr "项目设置"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Please create a new project to start with a clean slate. Your project should "
"contain one picture: the Rebel icon, which we often use for prototyping in "
"the community."
msgstr ""
"请从头开始创建一个新项目。您的项目应该包含一张图片：Godot 图标，我们经常在社"
